le difficulty, and remember to have fun collecting everything!", "summary": "A 3rd person Adventure in full 3d featuring Day and Night and expansive vistas.\nTooneQuest is a casual game where the player explores and captures creatures as they are discovered. Use the TooneDex to help find some of the trickier to find Toones.\nFind and capture all the 50 of the unique creatures hiding on the 5 islands.\nDiscover Abilities such as Jump, Crawl, Glide and Double-jump to help you navigate and explore the Islands.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/toonequest", "videos": [{"id": 188405, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "N2Dj1PYu2YA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N2Dj1PYu2YA", "title": "TooneQuest Short Promo", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N2Dj1PYu2YA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 188406, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "uZweFyuACM0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZweFyuACM0", "title": "TooneQuest 5 Minutes of Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uZweFyuACM0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}